# your personal scraper config to the repo
# ~/.philosophize_scraper.json is outside the repo anyway,
# but if you ever store a local copy here:
scraper_config.json

# Scraped transcript output (these are personal/local files)
*.md
# Re-include the README and LICENSE docs
!README.md

